        // 2) Contract balance increase due to Put is at least 0 and at most putValue: afterContractBal >= beforeContractBal && (afterContractBal - beforeContractBal) <= putValue
        // 3) Collect is atomic w.r.t balances: if it succeeded then both stored and contract balances decreased by collectAmt; if it reverted then both balances unchanged.
        assert(
            // Put monotonicity on holder balance
            afterHolderBal >= beforeHolderBal
            // Contract balance changed by at most putValue
            && afterContractBal >= beforeContractBal
            && (afterContractBal - beforeContractBal) <= putValue
            // Collect effect: success => final balances = after balances - collectAmt; revert => final balances == after balances
            && (
